{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレッスン終わりにメンバーと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんの総選挙を生放送で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人1人素晴らしいコメントを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言っていて心の底から伝わって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きました。涙なしではみれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位の渡辺麻友さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4位の指原莉乃さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におめでとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今思うとこんな素晴らしい方達と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事が出来ていたなんて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからはもっと良いところを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吸収をして成長して行きたいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね11:30ぐらいにお昼ご飯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を食